<title>GREECE: GREEK PREMIER TO VISIT DEVELOPMENT MINISTRY THURSDAY.</title>
<headline>GREEK PREMIER TO VISIT DEVELOPMENT MINISTRY THURSDAY.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek Prime Minister Costas Simitis will visit the development ministry on Thursday to discuss policy matters with Development Minister Vasso Papandreou and other high-levels officials, the ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
